511 can be geometrically matched directly to our roads

This is particularly good.

511's winter-road endpoint provides an EncodedPolyline representing the affected roadway portion. 

So instead of doing:

"Highway 16 has bad conditions somewhere"

we can do:

511 encoded polyline
        ↓
decode coordinates
        ↓
spatially intersect / map-match
        ↓
OSM road edges
        ↓
mark affected edges

Example:

edge 1103921
edge 1103922
edge 1103923

511 condition:
Partly snow covered

routing penalty = +25

But:

511 condition:
CLOSED

routing availability = FALSE

That is precisely how I would integrate it.

